{"id":"n17183-1-15","stage":1,"title":"얼굴 · 脸","scene":"青春期过后仍长痘","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17183-1-15-1","ko":"승규는 얼굴 전체에 여드름이 잔뜩 났더라.","zh":"我看承奎整张脸都长满痘痘了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴","meaning":"脸","explanation":"얼굴：脸；与后面的 전체 合用表示整张脸。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}},{"text":"전체에","meaning":"整个、全部","explanation":"전체：整个；얼굴 전체에 是“在整张脸上”。","readings":[{"term":"전체","audio":"/audio/a4b69faf0c1113faf1f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62391","senseId":"1","lemma":"전체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전체에","audio":"/audio/be0535bcd380f9d5f185.mp3"}},{"text":"여드름이","meaning":"粉刺，青春痘","explanation":"여드름：粉刺，青春痘；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여드름","audio":"/audio/04c5d9bb98863a39cd64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67696","senseId":"1","lemma":"여드름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여드름이","audio":"/audio/9d657d01ebd7eea54793.mp3"}},{"text":"잔뜩","meaning":"很多、满脸","explanation":"잔뜩：大量地、满满地；这里指痘痘长得很多。","readings":[{"term":"잔뜩","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69821","senseId":"1","lemma":"잔뜩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔뜩","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3"}},{"text":"났더라.","meaning":"长出来了、我看到了","explanation":"나다：长出来；-었더라 回顾亲眼看到的情况，这里说自己见到承奎脸上长了痘痘。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났더라","audio":"/audio/354d945c18b4e2bc8508.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"a4b69faf0c1113fa","term":"전체","zh":"全体","audio":"/audio/a4b69faf0c1113faf1f7.mp3","entryId":"62391","definition":"把由一个个或部分的集合组成的东西作为一个对象时所指的该对象。","pronunciation":["전체"]},{"id":"04c5d9bb98863a39","term":"여드름","zh":"粉刺，青春痘","audio":"/audio/04c5d9bb98863a39cd64.mp3","entryId":"67696","definition":"主要在青春期时在脸或身上凹凸出来的红色小炎症。","pronunciation":["여드름"]},{"id":"f48d09fc20ac9971","term":"잔뜩","zh":"大量地、满满地","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3","entryId":"69821","definition":"数量很多、布满某处；这里指痘痘长满脸。","pronunciation":["잔뜩"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"长出，发，生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"冒出皮肤表层或地面。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d78052e12d7f31b1d08.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17183-1-15-2","ko":"그러게, 사춘기도 지났는데 말야.","zh":"是啊，明明青春期都过了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게,","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"사춘기도","meaning":"青春期","explanation":"사춘기：青春期；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사춘기","audio":"/audio/e02d2bc35308b4fabe59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15905","senseId":"1","lemma":"사춘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사춘기도","audio":"/audio/389c7ad47e14b51cf995.mp3"}},{"text":"지났는데","meaning":"已经过了","explanation":"지나다：时间过去；-었- 表示已过，-는데 引出与当前长痘状况相反的背景。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지났는데","au